    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a novelist, Vincent Marlow was forced to abandon his writing after being falsely accused. Then one day, he receives a letter from Sofia, asking him to find her missing younger brother\u2014who disappeared in the place connected to the case that ruined his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/46549d2c0da4cf6159fbd502a27c1c97.poster.avif?t=1749710328\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/46549d2c0da4cf6159fbd502a27c1c97.webm?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/46549d2c0da4cf6159fbd502a27c1c97.mp4?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown - Raven Field is the first Episode in the Unknown series, a gripping mystery adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Storyline: Uncover the lost memories of Sofia, Noah, and Olivia. Discover the family's forgotten past and the hidden secrets of Raven Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Riddles: Search the village for hidden clues and solve puzzles to uncover the mysteries of Raven Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with Villagers: Engage with the villagers to get closer to the truth. Dive into their words and unravel the clues they hide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie Atmosphere: The suspenseful background music and meticulously designed environments deepen the mystery of Raven Field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/a66879585ea7505ef899c86c08c91731.poster.avif?t=1749710328\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/a66879585ea7505ef899c86c08c91731.webm?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/a66879585ea7505ef899c86c08c91731.mp4?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a novelist, Vincent Marlow was forced to abandon his writing after being falsely accused. Then one day, he receives a letter from Sofia, asking him to find her missing younger brother\u2014who disappeared in the place connected to the case that ruined his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/46549d2c0da4cf6159fbd502a27c1c97.poster.avif?t=1749710328\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/46549d2c0da4cf6159fbd502a27c1c97.webm?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/46549d2c0da4cf6159fbd502a27c1c97.mp4?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown - Raven Field is the first Episode in the Unknown series, a gripping mystery adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Storyline: Uncover the lost memories of Sofia, Noah, and Olivia. Discover the family's forgotten past and the hidden secrets of Raven Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Riddles: Search the village for hidden clues and solve puzzles to uncover the mysteries of Raven Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with Villagers: Engage with the villagers to get closer to the truth. Dive into their words and unravel the clues they hide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie Atmosphere: The suspenseful background music and meticulously designed environments deepen the mystery of Raven Field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/a66879585ea7505ef899c86c08c91731.poster.avif?t=1749710328\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/a66879585ea7505ef899c86c08c91731.webm?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/a66879585ea7505ef899c86c08c91731.mp4?t=1749710328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Unknown - Raven Field is a mystery adventure game featuring a deep story and intense atmosphere. In the suspicious village of Raven Field, chase the whereabouts of Sofia\u2019s missing younger brother, Noah, and get one step closer to proving Vincent Marlow\u2019s innocence.",
